   "subject": "Multi-level mediation with 2 mediators? Appropriate model?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#1155cc\">I want to conduct a multi-level multiple mediator analysis, but I don&#39;t know whether my code is right.</font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK18\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK18\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK19\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK18\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">TITLE: 1-(1,1)-1 model with\r\nrandom slope (MSEM);<u></u><u></u></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">DATA: FILE IS data14.dat;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">VARIABLE: NAMES ARE ID <a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK4\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK3\" rel=\"nofollow\">x\r\ny </a>M1 M2;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">USEVARIABLE=<a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK2\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK1\" rel=\"nofollow\">ID x y M1 M2</a>;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:42.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">MISSING=ALL(999);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:36.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">cluster=ID;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> ANALYSIS: TYPE = TWOLEVEL RANDOM;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> MODEL:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">%WITHIN%<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  sa1 | M1 on x;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  sa2 | M2 on x;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  M2 WITH M1;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  sb1 | Y on M1;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  sb2 | Y on M2;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  sc | Y on x;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  %BETWEEN%<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  sa1 sa2 sb1 sb2 sc M2 M1 x Y;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  <a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK7\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK6\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">sa1 with sc M1\r\nx Y</span></a><span style=\"background:yellow\">;</span>\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:94.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  <a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK9\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">sa2 </span></a><span style=\"background:yellow\">with sc M2 x Y; <a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK11\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK10\" rel=\"nofollow\"> ( I don’t know whether here should be “sa1 sa2\r\nwith sc M1 M2 x Y”)</a><u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  sa1 with sb1 (cab1);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  sa2 with sb2(cab2);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  <a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK17\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK16\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK15\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">sb1 </span></a><span style=\"background:yellow\">with sc M1 x Y;</span><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:94.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  <a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK14\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK13\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7596927485970260568_OLE_LINK12\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">sb2 </span></a><span style=\"background:yellow\">with sc M2 x Y;</span> <span style=\"background:yellow\">( I don’t know whether here should be “sa1 sa2 with sc M1 M2 x Y”)<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  sc with M1 M2 x Y;<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">M1 with M2;<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  M1 on x(ab1);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  M2 on x(ab2);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  Y on M1(bb1);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  Y on M2(bb2);<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  [sa1](aw1);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  [sa2](aw2);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  [sb1P](bw1);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  [sb2P](bw2);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> model constraint:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  new(a1 a2);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  a1=aw1+ab1;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  a2=aw2+ab2;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  new(b1 b2 indw1 indw2 indb1 indb2 conw conb);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  b1=bw1+bb1;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  b2=bw2+bb2;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  <span style=\"background:yellow\">indw1=aw1*bw1+cab1;<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background:yellow\"> \r\nindw2=aw2*bw2+cab2;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  indb1=a1*b1;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  indb2=a2*b2;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  conw=indw1-indw2;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  conb=indb1-indb2;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  OUTPUT: CINTERVAL;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
