     1,
     "\r\n\r\n \r\n  \r\n  \r\n \r\n <div style=\"word-break:break-word\"><div style=\"line-height:1;padding:0.5em\">Mplus? </div><div style=\"line-height:1;padding:0.3em\"><div>Am 30.05.20, 03:29 schrieb Feng Kong &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kong....@gmail.com</a>&gt;:</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0.8ex 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-break:break-word\"><div style=\"line-height:1;padding:0.3em\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0.8ex 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n  <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#1155cc\">I want to conduct a multi-level multiple mediator analysis, but I don&#39;t know whether my code is right.</font></p>\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a rel=\"nofollow\"><span><br></span></a></p>\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a rel=\"nofollow\"><span><br></span></a></p>\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"><span>TITLE: 1-(1,1)-1 model with random slope (MSEM);</span></a></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>DATA: FILE IS data14.dat;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>VARIABLE: NAMES ARE ID <a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\">x y </a>M1 M2;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>USEVARIABLE=<a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\">ID x y M1 M2</a>;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:42.0pt\"><span>MISSING=ALL(999);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:36.75pt\"><span>cluster=ID;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> ANALYSIS: TYPE = TWOLEVEL RANDOM;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> MODEL:</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt\"><span>%WITHIN%</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  sa1 | M1 on x;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  sa2 | M2 on x;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  M2 WITH M1;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  sb1 | Y on M1;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  sb2 | Y on M2;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  sc | Y on x;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  %BETWEEN%</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  sa1 sa2 sb1 sb2 sc M2 M1 x Y;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  <a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">sa1 with sc M1 x Y</span></a><span style=\"background:yellow\">;</span> </span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:94.5pt\"><span>  <a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">sa2 </span></a><span style=\"background:yellow\">with sc M2 x Y; <a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"> ( I don’t know whether here should be “sa1 sa2 with sc M1 M2 x Y”)</a></span></span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  sa1 with sb1 (cab1);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  sa2 with sb2(cab2);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  <a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">sb1 </span></a><span style=\"background:yellow\">with sc M1 x Y;</span></span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:94.5pt\"><span>  <a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">sb2 </span></a><span style=\"background:yellow\">with sc M2 x Y;</span> <span style=\"background:yellow\">( I don’t know whether here should be “sa1 sa2 with sc M1 M2 x Y”)</span></span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  sc with M1 M2 x Y;</span></p>\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><br></span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt\"><span>M1 with M2;</span></p>\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:10.5pt\"><span><br></span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  M1 on x(ab1);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  M2 on x(ab2);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  Y on M1(bb1);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  Y on M2(bb2);</span></p>\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><br></span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  [sa1](aw1);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  [sa2](aw2);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  [sb1P](bw1);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  [sb2P](bw2);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> model constraint:</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  new(a1 a2);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  a1=aw1+ab1;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  a2=aw2+ab2;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  new(b1 b2 indw1 indw2 indb1 indb2 conw conb);</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  b1=bw1+bb1;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  b2=bw2+bb2;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  <span style=\"background:yellow\">indw1=aw1*bw1+cab1;</span></span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"background:yellow\">  indw2=aw2*bw2+cab2;</span><span></span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  </span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  indb1=a1*b1;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  indb2=a2*b2;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  conw=indw1-indw2;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  conb=indb1-indb2;</span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p> \r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>  OUTPUT: CINTERVAL;</span><span></span></p>\r\n  </div> \r\n  <p></p></blockquote></div></div>"
