     "\r<br>2020-05-30 9:50 GMT+08:00, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">car...@web.de</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">car...@web.de</a>&gt;:\r<br>&gt; Mplus?\r<br>&gt; Am 30.05.20, 03:29 schrieb Feng Kong &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kong....@gmail.com</a>&gt;:\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; I want to conduct a multi-level multiple mediator analysis, but I don&#39;t\r<br>&gt;&gt; know whether my code is right.\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; TITLE: 1-(1,1)-1 model with random slope (MSEM);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; DATA: FILE IS data14.dat;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; VARIABLE: NAMES ARE ID x y M1 M2;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; USEVARIABLE=ID x y M1 M2;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; MISSING=ALL(999);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; cluster=ID;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;  ANALYSIS: TYPE = TWOLEVEL RANDOM;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;  MODEL:\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; %WITHIN%\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sa1 | M1 on x;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sa2 | M2 on x;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   M2 WITH M1;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sb1 | Y on M1;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sb2 | Y on M2;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sc | Y on x;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   %BETWEEN%\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sa1 sa2 sb1 sb2 sc M2 M1 x Y;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sa1 with sc M1 x Y;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sa2 with sc M2 x Y;  ( I don’t know whether here should be “sa1 sa2 with\r<br>&gt;&gt; sc M1 M2 x Y”)\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sa1 with sb1 (cab1);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sa2 with sb2(cab2);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sb1 with sc M1 x Y;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sb2 with sc M2 x Y; ( I don’t know whether here should be “sa1 sa2 with\r<br>&gt;&gt; sc M1 M2 x Y”)\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   sc with M1 M2 x Y;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; M1 with M2;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   M1 on x(ab1);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   M2 on x(ab2);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   Y on M1(bb1);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   Y on M2(bb2);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   [sa1](aw1);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   [sa2](aw2);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   [sb1P](bw1);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   [sb2P](bw2);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;  model constraint:\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   new(a1 a2);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   a1=aw1+ab1;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   a2=aw2+ab2;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   new(b1 b2 indw1 indw2 indb1 indb2 conw conb);\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   b1=bw1+bb1;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   b2=bw2+bb2;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   indw1=aw1*bw1+cab1;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   indw2=aw2*bw2+cab2;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   indb1=a1*b1;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   indb2=a2*b2;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   conw=indw1-indw2;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   conb=indb1-indb2;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt;   OUTPUT: CINTERVAL;\r<br>&gt;&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; --\r<br>&gt;&gt; You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups\r<br>&gt;&gt; &quot;lavaan&quot; group.\r<br>&gt;&gt; To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an\r<br>&gt;&gt; email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lavaan+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r<br>&gt;&gt; To view this discussion on the web visit\r<br>&gt;&gt; <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/cfa1a23f-fe12-4035-8490-028c4cf4ea03%40googlegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/cfa1a23f-fe12-4035-8490-028c4cf4ea03%2540googlegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792421680168000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0yjL_X-PMYOWePZ4VvN9pG\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/cfa1